le=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values$A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values$B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values$C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br><br></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/a44617cb-ed85-4399-abf4-d412b9c4254c%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/a44617cb-ed85-4399-abf4-d412b9c4254c%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396458454000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_yBMpKgl1IjbjztFzLnRM\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/a44617cb-ed85-4399-abf4-d412b9c4254c%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396458454000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cjFgu0q_sXjocNg1Ipm4u\">https://groups.google.com/d